  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NMJD Organisational Transformation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To enhance the overall effectiveness of NMJD as a development organisation and build its capacity as a technical resource able to provide organisational transformation services to CAFOD and Christian Aid partner organisations in Sierra Leone and Liberia.

Specific objectives 

1. To support NMJD to carry out a Strategic Review exercise and develop a comprehensive and well-articulated five-year Strategic Plan. 
2. To support NMJD to enhance its fundraising capacity.
3. To support NMJD to go through a process of organisational transformation in the areas of leadership, gender equity, self-determination and organisational culture, in order to better manage change and improve its effectiveness. 
4. To enhance NMJD&apos;s consulting skills to enable it to better support other local organisations towards Organisational Transformation and overall effectiveness.</narrative>
  </description>
